  "lessons": [
    "Probe the credential the consumer presents, not a proxy for it. Mirror the consumer's own auth call; gh api user is what the Copilot CLI itself does",
    "Classify auth failures by the operator action they require. Refusal blocks; rate limit and transport faults degrade, so a GitHub blip is not an outage",
    "Avoid: Gating a job on an upstream output with !=. Compare == 'true' so absence blocks",
    "Avoid: Adding fail-closed gating without producing the artifacts the gate consumes. Land the gate and the DID_NOT_RUN artifact in the same change"
  ]
